    "chunk_text": "PARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF\n\nSRI LANKA\n\nLocal Authorities Elections (Special Provisions)\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\nto provide for the calling of fresh nominations and the holding of elections in respect of certain local authorities where the elections of such local authorities have been called and postponed; and to provide for matters\n\nconnected therewith of incidental thereto.\n\nPresented by the Minister of Public Administration, Provincial\n\nCouncils and Local Government on 9th January 2025\n\n(Published in the Gazette on January 01, 2025)\n\nOrdered by Parliament to be printed\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA.\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5.\n\nPrice : Rs. 30.00Postage : Rs. 150.00\n\nThis Bill can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n[Bill No.2]\n\nLOCAL AUTHORITIES ELECTIONS ( SPECIAL PROVISIONS) 1\n\nAN ACT TO PROVIDE FOR THE CALLINGOF FRESH NOMINATIONS AND THEHOLDING OF ELECTIONS IN RESPECT OFCERTAIN LOCAL AUTHORITIES WHERETHE ELECTIONS OF SUCH LOCALAUTHORITIES HAVE BEEN CALLED ANDPOSTPONED; AND TO PROVIDE FORMATTERS CONNECTED THEREWITH ORINCIDENTAL THERETO.\n\nPreamble\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\nL.D.- O 76/2024\n\nWHEREAS notices of nominations were published under section 26 of the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance (Chapter 262), that nomination papers will be received in respect of elections to the Local Authorities set out in the Schedule hereto:\n\nAND WHEREAS March 9, 2023 was fixed for the holding of elections for the aforesaid Local Authorities :\n\nAND WHEREAS the said elections were not conducted on such date:"
