    "language": "en",
    "md5": "e3c14ecf6926df8677df593f1266c707",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1633,
    "chunk_text": "WHEREAS notices of nominations were published under section 26 of the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance (Chapter 262), that nomination papers will be received in respect of elections to the Local Authorities set out in the Schedule hereto:\n\nAND WHEREAS March 9, 2023 was fixed for the holding of elections for the aforesaid Local Authorities :\n\nAND WHEREAS the said elections were not conducted on such date:\n\nAND WHEREAS the Local Authority Elections (Amendment) Act, No. 30 of 2023 has come into operation on November 17, 2023 and it has become necessary to provide for the nominations by the youth candidates in accordance with the provisions relating to the nomination of youth candidates under section 28 of the Local Authority Elections Ordinance, (chapter 262), when holding fresh election in respect of such Local Authorities set out in the Schedule hereto:\n\nPL 15051 - 275 (2025/01)\n\nLOCAL AUTHORITIES ELECTIONS ( SPECIAL PROVISIONS) 2\n\nProvisions relating to nominations, notices and deposits in respect of elections to certain Local Authorities\n\nAND WHEREAS due to the period of time that has elapsed since the submission of nominations in respect of such Local Authorities set out in the Schedule hereto, it has become necessary to provide for the calling of fresh nominations and to make provisions for the holding of fresh elections in respect of such Local Authorities set out in the Schedule hereto:\n\nNOW THEREFORE, BE it in enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows :-\n\n1. This Act may be cited as the Local AuthoritiesElections (Special Provisions) Act, No. of 2024."
  },
