    "chunk_text": "THE GAZETTE OF THE DEMOCRATIC\n\nSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF\n\nSRI LANKA\n\nPart II of December 27, 2024\n\nSUPPLEMENT\n\n(Issued on 01.01.2025)\n\nLocal Authorities Elections (Special Provisions)\n\nA BILL to provide for the calling of Fresh nominations and the holding of elections in respect of certain local authorities where the elections of such local authorities have been called and postponed; and to provide for matters\n\nconnected therewith of incidental thereto.\n\nOrdered to be published by the Minister of Public Administration,\n\nProvincial Councils and Local Government\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA.\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5.\n\nPrice : Rs. 30.00 Postage : Rs. 150.00\n\nThis Gazette Supplement can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\nLOCAL AUTHORITIES ELECTIONS\n\n( SPECIAL PROVISIONS) 1"
