    "chunk_text": "(7) If a Member of the Commission becomes temporarilyunable to perform the duties of office by reason of illness orother infirmity, or absence from Sri Lanka, or any other suchreason, the President may appoint any other person to act inhis place until such member is able to resume office.\n\n(8) The provisions of section 3 shall mutatis mutandisapply in respect of acting appointments made in terms ofsubsections (6) and (7) of this section.\n\n5. The Chairperson and at least three other members ofthe Commission shall work full time. The ConstitutionalCouncil shall designate, which of the members are appointedon full time basis.\n\n6. The Commission shall appoint an \u201cinformation officer\u201dand a \u201cdesignated officer\u201d for the purpose of the Right toInformation Act, No. 12 of 2016.\n\n7. (1) The Commission shall conduct sittings as providedin subsection (5) of section 2 to receive, obtain and collectinformation and material in respect of the matters referred toin section 12.\n\n(2) The Commission shall undertake investigations andinquiries by panels consisting of not less than three members\n\nFull timemembers\n\nInformationofficer anddesignatedofficer\n\nSittings ofthecommission\n\n7Commission for Truth, Unity andReconciliation in Sri Lanka\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\nof the Commission. The members shall be assigned to thepanels by the Chairperson of the Commission. One memberof such panel shall be designated as the Chairperson of thepanel by the Chairperson of the Commission.\n\n(3) All sittings of the Commission shall, subject to theprovisions of subsection (4), be held in public, and all personsshall be entitled freely to attend such sittings.\n\n(4) The Commission may, in its discretion, whenever itconsiders it desirable, including -\n\n(a)in proceedings relating to sexual matters;\n\n(b)in the interests of national security or public safety;\n\n(c)in the interest of personal security of any person;\n\n(d)in the interest of guaranteeing confidentiality orcreating an enabling environment for truth telling;"
