e Sinhalaand Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.\n\nShort title\n\nAmendmentof certainsections ofChapter 19specified inthe Schedule\n\n10\n\n15\n\nSinhala textto prevail incase ofinconsistency\n\nAvoidance ofdoubt"
