    "chunk_text": "THE GAZETTE OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nPart II of July 26, 2024\n\nSUPPLEMENT\n\n(Issued on 01.08.2024)\n\nNATIONAL MINIMUM WAGE OF WORKERS(AMENDMENT)\n\nto amend the National Minimum Wage of Workers Act, No. 3 of 2016\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nPrice : Rs. 6.00Postage : Rs. 150.00\n\n2-2d\n\nThis Gazette Supplement can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\nOrdered to be published by the Minister of Labourand Foreign Employment\n\nSTATEMENT OF LEGAL EFFECT\n\nClause 2 : This clause amends section 3 of the of the National Minimum Wage of\n\nWorkers Act, No. 3 of 2016 and the legal effect of that section as amended is to increase\n\nthe national monthly and daily wages of workers.\n\nNational Minimum Wage ofWorkers (Amendment)1\n\n5\n\nShort title\n\n10\n\nL. D.- O. 29/2024\n\nAN ACT TO AMEND THE NATIONAL MINIMUM WAGE OF WORKERSACT, NO. 3 OF 2016\n\nBE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows :-\n\n1. This Act may be cited as the National Minimum Wageof Workers (Amendment) Act, No. of 2024.\n\n2. Section 3 of the National Minimum Wage of WorkersAct, No. 3 of 2016 is hereby amended in subsection (1)thereof, by the substitution for the words \u201ctwelve thousandfive hundred rupees and the national minimum daily wageof a worker shall be five hundred rupees\u201d, of the words\u201cseventeen thousand five hundred rupees and the nationalminimum daily wage of a worker shall be seven hundredrupees\u201d.\n\n3. In the event of any inconsistency between the Sinhalaand Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.\n\nAmendmentof section 3 ofAct, No. 3 of2016\n\nSinhala textto prevail incase ofinconsistency\n\n2National Minimum Wage ofWorkers (Amendment)\n\nDepartment of Government Printing"
