    "chunk_text": "THE GAZETTE OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nPart II of July 26, 2024\n\nSUPPLEMENT\n\n(Issued on 31.07.2024)\n\nMATERNITY BENEFITS (AMENDMENT)\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\nto amend the Maternity Benefits Ordinance (Chapter 140)\n\nTo be presented in Parliament byHon. (Dr.) Mrs. Sudarshini Fernandopulle, M.P. for Gampaha District\n\nPrice : Rs. 6.00Postage : Rs. 150.00\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nThis Gazette Supplement can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n(Private Members\u2019 Bill)\n\nMaternity Benefits (Amendment)1\n\n5\n\nShort title\n\n10\n\n15\n\nAN ACT TO AMEND THE MATERNITY BENEFITSORDINANCE (CHAPTER 140)\n\nBE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows: -\n\n1. This Act may be cited as the Maternity Benefits(Amendment) Act, No. of 2024.\n\n2. Section 3 of the Maternity Benefits Ordinance(hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipal enactment\u201d) is herebyamended by the insertion of subsection (1) (c) and (1) (d) ofthat section, as follows:-\n\n''(c) seven days from the date of miscarriage, if themiscarriage occurs in the first twenty eight weeksof pregnancy; and\n\n(d) seven days from the date of termination ofpregnancy under medical grounds''.\n\n3. In the event of any inconsistency between the Sinhalaand Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.\n\nAmendmentof section 3of theprincipalenactment\n\nSinhala textto prevail incase ofinconsistency\n\n2Maternity Benefits (Amendment)\n\nDepartment of Government Printing"
