    "chunk_text": "THE GAZETTE OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nPart II of May 31, 2024\n\nSUPPLEMENT\n\n(Issued on 06.06.2024)\n\nCOLOMBO ASSOCIATION OF LANGUAGE SKILLSAND DRAMATIC ART (INCORPORATION)\n\nto incorporate Colombo Association of Language Skillsand Dramatic Art\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nPrice : Rs. 24.00Postage : Rs. 150.00\n\n2-2d\n\nThis Gazette Supplement can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\nTo be presented in Parliament by Hon. Shanakiyan RajaputhiranRasamanickam for Batticaloa District\n\n(Private Members\u2019 Bill)\n\nColombo Association of Language Skills andDramatic Art (Incorporation)1\n\nAN ACT TO INCORPORATE COLOMBO ASSOCIATION OF LANGUAGESKILLS AND DRAMATIC ART\n\nWHEREAS an Association called and known as the \u201cColomboAssociation of Language Skills and Dramatic Art\u201d hasheretofore been established in Sri Lanka for the purpose ofeffectually carrying out its objects and transacting all mattersconnected with the said Association according to the rulesagreed to by its members :\n\nAND WHEREAS the said Association has heretoforesuccessfully carried out and transacted the several objectsand matters for which it was established, and has applied tobe incorporated and it will be for the public advantage togrant the said application:\n\nBE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows :\u2014\n\n1. This Act may be cited as the Colombo Association ofLanguage Skills and Dramatic Art (Incorporation)Act, No. 2024."
  },
