    "chunk_text": "THE GAZETTE OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nPart II of May 22, 2024\n\nSUPPLEMENT\n\n(Issued on 30.05.2024)\n\nMEDICAL (AMENDMENT)\n\nto amend the Medical Ordinance (Chapter 105)\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nPrice : Rs. 12.00Postage : Rs. 150.00\n\n2-2d\n\nThis Gazette Supplement can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\nOrdered to be published by the Minister of Health\n\nSTATEMENT OF LEGAL EFFECT\n\nClause 2 : This clause amends section 19 of the Medical Ordinance (Chapter 105)(hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipal enactment\u201d) in order to add certain matters inrespect of which regulations can be made by the Minister.\n\nClause 3 : This clause amends section 19C of the principal enactment and the legaleffect of the section as amended is to provide for the appointment of a Committee toadvice the Minister regarding any recommendation made by the Medical Council inrespect of any recognized university or institution under subsection (1) of section 19C.\n\nClause 4 : This clause amends section 19E of the principal enactment for betterexplanation of the term \u201cany university or institution\u201d.\n\nClause 5 : This clause amends section 29 of the principal enactment and is consequentialto the amendment made by clause 2.\n\nMedical (Amendment)1\n\n5\n\nL. D.- O. 2/2024\n\nAN ACT TO AMEND THE MEDICAL ORDINANCE (CHAPTER 105)\n\nBE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows: -\n\n1. This Act may be cited as the Medical (Amendment)Act, No. of 2024.\n\n2. Section 19 of the Medical Ordinance (Chapter 105)(hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipal enactment\u201d) is herebyamended as follows:-\n\n(1)in paragraph (f) thereof, by the substitution for thewords \u201cuniversities and other institutions.\u201d of thewords \u201cuniversities and other institutions;\u201d; and\n\n(2)immediately after paragraph (f) thereof, by theaddition of the following:-"
