any inconsistency between the Sinhalaand Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.25\n\nShort title\n\nAmendmentto Article 99Aof theConstitution\n\nSinhala textto prevail incase ofinconsistency\n\n2Twenty Second Amendment to the Constitution"
