    "chunk_text": "PARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n[Bill No. 262]\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nPresented by Hon. (Dr.) (Mrs.) Sudarshini Fernandopulle, M.P.for Gampaha District on 22nd of May, 2024\n\n(Published in the Gazette on May 08, 2024)\n\nOrdered by Parliament to be printed\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nPrice : Rs. 6.00Postage : Rs. 150.00\n\n2-2d\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nThis Bill can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\nPARLIAMENTARY ELECTIONS (AMENDMENT)\n\nto amend the Parliamentary Elections Act, No. 1 of 1981\n\n1 Parliamentary Elections (Amendment)\n\nShort title\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\nAN ACT TO AMEND THE PARLIAMENTARY ELECTIONSACT, NO. 1 OF 1981\n\nBE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as Parliamentary Elections(Amendment) Act, No. of 2024.\n\n2. Section 7 of the Parliamentary Elections Act,No. 1 of 1981 (hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipalenactment\u201d as amended by Act, No. 58 of 2009, is herebyfurther amended by the repeal of subsection 4(d) andsubstitution thereof, with the following:-\n\n\u201c(d)In order to guarantee better representation ofwomen in political parties and in politics,every recognized political party shall ensurethe inclusion of not less than thirty per centumof women office bearers, in a decision makingcapacity, in the list of office bearers of suchparty.\u201d.\n\n3.In the event of any inconsistency between the Sinhalaand Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.\n\nAmendmentof Section 7of theParliamentaryElectionsAct,No. 1 of1981\n\nSinhala textto prevail incase ofinconsistency\n\n2 Parliamentary Elections (Amendment)\n\nDEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING"
